Subject: [PATCH] Adapt KDE Plasma Mobile 6.7.5 to Droidian Wayfire on eqs

Base: KDE 10773c81e36b322f307737391f836126d1115277 (v6.7.5).
Droidian reference: 91ba13c86f6893fed1505acf97c5594a67318ab3.
Includes eqs5 safety/navigation/rotation/locale, 6.7 panel integration and
pre2 lockscreen palette isolation. See UPGRADE-6.7.md for device evidence;
this is not a promoted image input.
Apply to the clean KDE Git source, not to the existing eqs5 build.

